    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
          <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">our business strategy, expected capital spending and other plans and objectives for future operations, including our ability to expand our business as a new entrant to the tanker shipping industry;</div>
        </td>

