    <td style="width: 16pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
          <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">the sentiment of the significant number of retail investors whom we believe, will hold our common shares, in part due to direct access by retail investors to broadly available trading platforms, and whose
            investment thesis may be influenced by views expressed on financial trading and other social media sites and online forums;</div>
        </td>

  </tr>


</table>
  <div>&#160;</div>

  <div style="clear: both; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;" class="BRPFPageBreakArea">
