  <div style="color: #000000; font-style: italic;">Gain on sale of vessel</div>

  <div><br />
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000;">Refer to discussion under &#8220;<span style="font-style: italic;">Combined Results of Operations &#8212; Gain on sale of vessel</span>&#8221; above for details on the sale of the <span style="font-style: italic;">M/T Wonder Arcturus</span>.</div>

