  <div><span style="font-weight: bold; color: #000000;">A.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160; <span style="font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Offer and Listing Details</span></div>

  <div>&#160;</div>

  <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000;">Our common shares currently trade on the Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol &#8220;TORO&#8221;.</div>

  <div>&#160;</div>

  <div><span style="font-weight: bold; color: #000000;">B.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160; <span style="font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Plan of Distribution</span></div>

  <div>&#160;</div>

  <div style="text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000;">Not applicable.</div>

  <div><br />
  </div>

