</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

          <ix:continuation id="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae20" continuedAt="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae21">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae21" continuedAt="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae22">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The weighted average interest rate on long-term debt for the period ended December 31, 2021 and the year ended December 31,
            2022, was <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtWeightedAverageInterestRate" id="Fact_085b8246c4964de2a807c7417c0c717d" contextRef="c20211231" unitRef="U004" decimals="3" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.3</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtWeightedAverageInterestRate" id="Fact_379529bec87c4e7fabc8d3deafcb97d2" contextRef="c20221231" unitRef="U004" decimals="3" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4.9</ix:nonFraction>%,
            respectively.</div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae22" continuedAt="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae23">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baf26b93758f4d5cbf580596399d44ae23">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">Total interest incurred on long-term debt for the period ended December 31, 2021, and the year ended December 31, 2022, amounted
            to $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseLongTermDebt" id="Fact_da48bde16e844f0aa153dde66b224b9a" contextRef="c20210113to20211231" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">383,186</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseLongTermDebt" id="Fact_631538dd00024cc78e45b6825c70a3e0" contextRef="c20220101to20221231" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">719,105</ix:nonFraction>,
            respectively, and is included in Interest and finance costs (Note 11) in the accompanying combined carve-out statements of comprehensive (loss)/income.</div>
</ix:continuation>

          <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>

