                <div style="color: #000000; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">NOTES TO COMBINED CARVE-OUT FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div>

                <div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">(Expressed in U.S. Dollars &#8211; unless otherwise stated)</div>

