      <div>
        <a id="f27BasisofPresentationandGen"><!--Anchor--></a><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:OrganizationConsolidationAndPresentationOfFinancialStatementsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Text_df932b78e04b4f069c53faf13917bc47" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember" escape="true" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25891">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;">1.</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Basis of Presentation and General information</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:nonNumeric>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25891" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25892">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-indent: 18pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25892" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25893">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color: #000000;">Toro Corp. (&#8220;Toro&#8221; or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) was formed on July 29, 2022 as a wholly owned subsidiary of Castor Maritime
            Inc. (&#8220;Castor&#8221; or the &#8220;Parent&#8221;) under the laws of the Republic of the Marshall Islands under the name Tankco Shipping Inc. and changed its name to Toro Corp. on September 29, 2022 for the purpose of acquiring the tanker fleet of Castor.&#160; The
            Company as of December 31, 2022 had <ix:nonFraction name="toro:PercentageOwnershipInSubsidiary" id="Fact_d2b34646b9474fd78edb01928d718f60" contextRef="c20221231_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction>% equity ownership in </span>Toro RBX Corp. (&#8220;Toro RBX&#8221;), an entity&#160; incorporated <span style="color: #000000;">on October 3, 2022,&#160; under the laws of the Marshall Islands to serve as Toro&#8217;s cash manager.</span></div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25893" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25894">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25894" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25895">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">On March 7, 2023, Castor separated its tanker fleet from its dry bulk and container fleet by, among other actions, contributing to
          Toro its interest in the subsidiaries comprising its tanker fleet, each owning on March 7, 2023, as per the table below, <ix:nonFraction name="toro:NumberOfVesselsOwnedByEachSubsidiary" id="Fact_b2c03a82fe264d11aa36cfc269e3d763" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U005" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction> tanker
          vessel and Elektra Shipping Co. (collectively the &#8220; Tanker Fleet&#8221;), in exchange for all <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" id="Fact_52d047b0b2c54ac6abab5334af7b806a" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" id="Fact_bcb3de7e4e9f4225ad60268ba295ba31" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9,461,009</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> of Toro&#8217;s issued and outstanding
          common shares, the issue of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" id="Fact_9c0279ed0cf44584b3cdb679d450799e" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">140,000</ix:nonFraction> <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage" id="Fact_920af9e265fc42d785d1cc6ee2c52324" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction>%
          Series A Fixed rate Cumulative Perpetual Convertible Preferred Shares of Toro to Castor having a stated amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="toro:PreferredStockStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_9309d74d3a8340f7b0adb7d83bdb120e" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,000</ix:nonFraction> and par value
          of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_7efc561d21ed47b38bc5a0ba94508636" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share and the issuance to Pelagos Holdings Corp, a company controlled by the Company&#8217;s Chairman and Chief Executive
          Officer, of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" id="Fact_c3f598f5e8644f35a1269fea1684e87a" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">40,000</ix:nonFraction> Series B preferred shares of Toro, par value $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_f730e0b2813f4b648ded54ec5c5a95bf" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share. The Toro common shares were distributed on March 7, 2023 pro rata to the shareholders of record of Castor as of February 22, 2023.</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25895" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25896">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25896" continuedAt="Text_22c33488a3314811a878a7c3ffbf25897">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">Toro shares began trading on the Nasdaq Capital Market on March 7,2023.</div>
</ix:continuation>
