    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Elektra Shipping Co., no longer owns any vessel following the sale of the M/T Wonder Arcturus on May 9, 2022, and delivery of such vessel to an unaffiliated third-party on July 15, 2022.</div>
