    <td style="width: 18pt;"><br />
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;">The carrying value reported of Cash overdraft is a reasonable estimate of its fair value due to short-term maturity and is considered Level 1 item in fair value hierarchy.</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
