        <ix:continuation id="Text_8804d439dd9d46be9dc1df1dc8843a7a2">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" id="Fact_a91aa86ad4bc42038e34432109aa6a3b" contextRef="c20220729to20221231_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">32</ix:nonFraction>
          which is presented in the statement of comprehensive loss is related to bank charges.</div>
</ix:continuation>

        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


  </div>
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

    <div>
      <div>
        <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Text_09f6c0375cb44153a1818307c3816b0e" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember" escape="true" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f1">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;">5.</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Subsequent Events:</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:nonNumeric>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f1" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f2">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f2" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f3">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 18pt;"> <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;">(a)</span>&#160; <span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;">Increase



              in Authorized Capital Stock:&#160; </span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';">On March 2, 2023 the Company&#8217;s articles of incorporation were amended to increase the Company&#8217;s authorized common shares to <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" id="Fact_8a1bddac59f74a6aa822e3885d28d501" contextRef="c20230302_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-8" scale="9" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.9</ix:nonFraction> billion common shares, each with par value $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_1271662083d946e09d68160df737573a" contextRef="c20230302_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction>
              per share, and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" id="Fact_4031d3b5f9194ae59178389bcac88a7f" contextRef="c20230302_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-8" scale="9" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> billion preferred shares, each with par value $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_f3a1046d60c3420e84fee6d4058c6138" contextRef="c20230302_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share</span></span></div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f3" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f4">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> <br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f4" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f5">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">(b)&#160; Completion of the Spin-Off:</span>&#160; On March 7, 2023, (&#8220;Distribution Date&#8221;) Castor completed the Spin-Off of
          the Company based on the terms approved by <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">the independent disinterested directors of Castor approved, and the recommendation of the Special Committee on November 15, 2022 and December 30, 2022</span> .</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f5" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f6">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f6" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f7">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">In connection with of the Spin-Off,&#160; the following was completed on March 7 , 2023:</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f7" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f8">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f8" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f9">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt;"><br />
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;">the contribution to the Company of the Castor&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction name="toro:NumberOfTankerOwningSubsidiaries" id="Fact_eec41d19dc164428b95330cebd396a41" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U015" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">eight</ix:nonFraction> tanker-owning
                  subsidiaries (each owning <ix:nonFraction name="toro:NumberOfVesselsOwnedByEachSubsidiary" id="Fact_69dee16bba9248abbf1f3468daf0779a" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U005" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction> tanker vessel) and an additional subsidiary formerly owning the M/T Wonder Arcturus (the &#8220;Toro
                  subsidiaries&#8221;);</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f9" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f10">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f10" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f11">
<div>
          <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt;"><br />
                </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#8226;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                  <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">in exchange for:</span></div>
                </td>

  </tr>


</table>
          <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>

        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f11" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f12">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 36pt;"><br />
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#9675;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" id="Fact_b9c115943ba7495481746fb6bc36f1f8" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9,461,009</ix:nonFraction> common shares of Toro&#8217;s common stock, par value $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_8cfb51fc6c9a46169978d25630ccdc76" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Toro common shares&#8221;);</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f12" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f13">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f13" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f14">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 36pt;"><br />
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#9675;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" id="Fact_c7348cfc74054ff8b4494c1388a63066" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">140,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage" id="Fact_fefc6993d7054eeab6fee87ccdb29a69" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction>% Series A Fixed Rate Cumulative Perpetual Convertible Preferred Shares (the &#8220;Toro Series A Preferred Shares&#8221;), with a cumulative preferred distribution accruing
                  initially at a rate of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage" id="Fact_c33ca08b03c6415c8b63e8ecab541bf6" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction>% per annum on the stated amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="toro:PreferredStockStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_b23ec90af9d541119bde6a283f1d8a0f" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,000</ix:nonFraction> per share, all of which would be retained by Castor after the Spin-Off; and</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f14" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f15">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f15" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f16">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 36pt;"><br />
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: #000000;">&#9675;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;">the issuance of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" id="Fact_4b28a47243f14ba8b295a629d22106f7" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">40,000</ix:nonFraction> Series B Preferred Shares (the &#8220;Toro Series B
                  Preferred Shares&#8221;), each carrying <ix:nonFraction name="toro:PreferredStockVotingRightsNumberOfVotes" id="Fact_435b841b64e440f19560cbedc4c555b0" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U016" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100,000</ix:nonFraction> votes on all matters on which Company&#8217;s shareholders are entitled to vote but <ix:nonFraction name="toro:PreferredStockEconomicRights" id="Fact_2a06af0e4d084cfd9af3c2820cc74666" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U017" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction> economic rights, to Pelagos, a company controlled by Company&#8217;s and Castor&#8217;s Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, against payment of their
                  nominal value of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" id="Fact_24a4d6f87c5045c4b2f53d263f6cdbe9" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="3" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per Toro Series B Preferred Share.</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
        <div>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f16" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f17">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>
</ix:continuation>
        </div>

        <div>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f17" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f18">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The Toro Series A Preferred Shares retained by the Castor have an initial aggregate stated amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockValue" id="Fact_6b601b33c5f94f0abea89140ea72c503" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">140,000,000</ix:nonFraction>. The Toro Series A Preferred Shares are convertible, in whole or in part, at their holder&#8217;s option, to Toro common shares from and after
            the third anniversary of their issue date and prior to the seventh anniversary of such date at the lower of (i) <ix:nonFraction name="toro:PercentageOfVolumeWeightedAveragePrice" id="Fact_9a2b5806c3ac4649b0365abbcac29c0f" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U004" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">150</ix:nonFraction>% of the volume
            weighted average price (&#8220;VWAP&#8221;) of Toro&#8217;s common shares over the <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_f5eb37c8be1f46979e87ba03888ede81">five</span> consecutive trading day period commencing on and including the
            Distribution Date, and (ii) the VWAP of the Toro common shares over the <ix:nonNumeric name="toro:ConsecutiveTradingDayPeriod" id="Fact_8d0706e60889450c93cf7e075f3e00e3" contextRef="c20230307to20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_RangeAxis_MaximumMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" format="ixt-sec:durday">10</ix:nonNumeric> consecutive trading day period expiring on the trading
            day immediately prior to the date of delivery of written notice of the conversion; provided, that, in no event shall the conversion price be less than $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionPrice" id="Fact_d1172a8b08ec4cfc85929aa75e507bf9" contextRef="c20230307_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_ToroCorpMember_RangeAxis_MinimumMember_StatementClassOfStockAxis_SeriesAFixedRateCumulativePerpetualConvertiblePreferredSharesMember_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.50</ix:nonFraction>.</div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f18" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f19">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f19" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f20">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">On the Distribution Date, Castor distributed all of the Company common shares outstanding to its holders of common stock of
            record at the close of business on February 22, 2023 (the &#8220;Record Date&#8221;). Shareholders of Castor received <ix:nonFraction name="toro:NumberOfSharesOfCommonStockIssuedUponCompletionOfSpinOff" id="Fact_04ad15c4abcd43ad955b5430f1b8fe46" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction> Toro common share for
            every <ix:nonFraction name="toro:NumberOfSharesOfCommonStockHeldToReceiveStockIssuedUponCompletionOfSpinOff" id="Fact_dd8c67fa0a59405d9ddc5277be3dcb95" contextRef="c20230307_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">ten</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Castor&#8217;s common stock owned at the Record Date.</div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f20" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f21">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
          </div>
</ix:continuation>
          <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f21" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f22">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">As a part of the Spin-Off, the Company entered into a master management agreement with Castor Ships with respect to its vessels
            in substantially the same form as the Castor&#8217;s Master Management Agreement for its vessels. The vessel management agreements with Castor Ships previously entered into for each of the vessels by the applicable vessel-owning Toro Subsidiary will
            remain in effect for each such vessel.</div>
</ix:continuation>
        </div>

        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f22" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f23">
<div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <div class="BRPFPageBreakArea" style="clear: both; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;">
          <div style="text-align: center;" class="BRPFPageNumberArea"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;">F-29</span></div>

          <div class="BRPFPageBreak" style="page-break-after: always;">
            <hr style="margin: 4px 0px; width: 100%; border-width: 0; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; clear: both;" /></div>

          <div style="width: 100%;" class="BRPFPageHeader">
            <div>
              <div style="color: #000000; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">TORO CORP.</div>

              <div style="color: #000000; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div>

              <div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">(Expressed in U.S. Dollars &#8211; unless otherwise stated)</div>

            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f23" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f24">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color: #000000;">In addition, as part of the Spin-Off, the Company entered into various other agreements effecting the separation of
            its business from Castor including </span>a Contribution and Spin-Off Distribution Agreement, pursuant to which, among other things, (i) Castor agreed to indemnify the Company and its vessel-owning subsidiaries for any and all obligations and
          other liabilities arising from or relating to the operation, management or employment of vessels or subsidiaries Castor retains after the Distribution Date and Company agreed to indemnify Castor for any and all obligations and other liabilities
          arising from or relating to the operation, management or employment of the vessels contributed to it or its vessel-owning subsidiaries, and (ii) the Company agreed to replace Castor as guarantor under the $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" id="Fact_c5e210f342eb482eba5437af135353f8" contextRef="c20230307_DebtInstrumentAxis_SeniorSecuredTeamLoanFacilityAlphaBankSA2021Member_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">18.0</ix:nonFraction> Million Term Loan Facility upon completion of the Spin-Off. The Contribution and Spin-Off Distribution Agreement also provided for the settlement or extinguishment of
          certain liabilities and other obligations between Castor and Toro and provides Castor with certain registration rights relating to Toro&#8217;s common shares, if any, issued upon conversion of the Toro Series A preferred shares issued to Castor in
          connection with the Spin-Off.</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f24" continuedAt="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f25">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold; color: #000000;"> </span><br />
        </div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_baabb1c2af194dea944d40ea99e2405f25">
<div style="display:none;"><br /></div>
<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-weight: normal;">Following the successful completion of the Spin Off </span>Toro will reimburse Castor for
          expenses related to the Spin off that have been incurred by Castor, provided that Toro will not reimburse Castor for any of these expenses that were incurred or paid by any of the Toro subsidiaries of Castor up to March 7, 2023.</div>
</ix:continuation>

        <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> <span style="font-size: 8pt;">F-30</span><br />
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">
          <hr style="height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; text-align: center; border: none; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" />
<div><span style="font-size: 8pt;"> </span></div>
</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 18pt; color: #000000;">
          <hr style="background-color: #000000; border-bottom: medium none; border-left: medium none; border-right: medium none; border-top: medium none; margin: 0px auto; color: #000000; text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" /> </div>

